Determining which components to upgrade (Upgrading from Version 5.1 to Version 5.3)
Last Updated: 2026-08-20

To successfully upgrade from IBM® Software Hub Version 5.1 to Version 5.3 refresh, you must determine which components are installed for the instance of IBM Software Hub that you want to upgrade.

Upgrade phase

